<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 8005 0 R/Alt(A bright star at the centre of a dark field of stars, surrounded by about a dozen nested, evenly spaced rings of reddish dust. The rings are not complete: they are brightest towards the upper right and the lower left, and they look like a set of concentric, roughly square ripples spreading out from the star.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[128]/Pg 18654 0 R>>
