<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 12076 0 R/Alt(Three panels showing horizontal magnetic field lines in a vertical slice of a stratified atmosphere at three times. In the first panel the field lines are straight and horizontal. In the second they start to bend, rising in the middle. In the third they form a large arch, with velocity arrows showing gas sliding down along the field lines into the valleys on either side.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 18730 0 R>>
